                    },
                    "message": "Please add a Tested section which makes sure the update reflects after this change. Refer to https://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-bmc-code-mgmt/commit/f730973b554c83b7a8e85232e9c730a89d5f3692 to see list of what needs to be tested. Also please test with AC cycle to make sure the update sticks."
