                        "username": "DirkChen0105"
                    },
                    "message": "Follow the test section and revise the commit message.\nPlease review it to see whether it meets your expectations."
                },
                {
                    "file": "i2c-vr/mps/mpq87xx.cpp",
                    "line": 264,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Is 2 also a satisfactory number as per update guide for this chip?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "i2c-vr/mps/mpq87xx.cpp",
                    "line": 264,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "DirkChen0105",
                        "email": "dirkchen@amd.com",
                        "username": "DirkChen0105"
                    },
                    "message": "yes.\nAccording to configuration user guide (AN203), the flowcharts on Figure 3.\nIn the final step, check CRC value.\n\nif (match CRC)\n{\n\u3000\u3000\u3000 Configuration complete.\n}\nelse \n{\n\u3000\u3000\u3000 if (first time failing)\n\u3000\u3000\u3000 {\n\u3000\u3000\u3000 \u3000\u3000\u3000 retry and write all registers in the configuration file\n\u3000\u3000\u3000 }\n\u3000\u3000\u3000 else\n\u3000\u3000\u3000 {\n\u3000\u3000\u3000 \u3000\u3000\u3000 return fail.\n\u3000\u3000\u3000 }\n}"
                }
            ],
